  "name": "Snap Shot (Ex)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A thief with this talent may treat her initiative roll as a 20 for a surprise round, regardless of her initiative, but she may only take an attack action with a ranged weapon. Her normal initiative roll is used in subsequent rounds. If two or more thieves possess this talent, their initiative determines the order in which they act, but they all go before any other creature. If a thief is prevented from acting in the surprise round, this talent has no effect.</p>",
